#showas:入门仪式
#sortorder:2
Traditionally, beating two difficulty-7 AIs has been considered the boundary between a novice/learning AI War 2 player and an experienced one.  

Rite of Passage is played against two such AIs, default Full Ensemble type, on an 80-planet Realistic galaxy - also the default.  

If you've completed at least one Basic quickstart, or even if you haven't and want to know if you measure up to the 'standard' challenge, this scenario is for you.  

Leaving the campaign type on Humanity Ascendant is recommended.  